## Dashboard

### Power BI Dashboard Includes

- Year-wise Sales Analysis
- Sales by Region
- Sales by Market
- Sales by Segment
- Profit by Customer
- Top 5 Profit by Product
- Bottom 5 Profit by Product
- Return Order Analysis
- Interactive Filters & Slicers

![Amazon Global Sales Dashboard](image/pic.png)

## Final Recommendations

- Focus marketing efforts on Consumer Segment customers.
- Promote highly profitable products.
- Review loss-making products.
- Reduce return rates through quality control.
- Expand in high-performing markets.
- Improve inventory planning using sales trends.

